PROOF-FRONTIER READOUT
new_target_1=prove a certificate-Helly lemma: every primitive non-AP row violates
  at least one of the layer/AP-support/Toeplitz certificates by a usable margin.
new_target_2=treat the exchange and compression traps as sheaf stalks; discharge
  each stalk by the first dictionary coordinate where it has visible deficit.
new_target_3=transport Toeplitz moment-cone slack through the Joukowski/Hermite-Biehler
  bridge to an even/odd interlacing statement, with Worpitzky/associator debt named.
